 "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}], "size": [357.1148376464844, 35.52560043334961], "pos": [1180.0289306640625, 4863.13232421875], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 468, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}], "flags": {}, "id": 254, "type": "MiniMaxH3MemoryEfficientSageAttentionPatch", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui-kjnodes", "ver": "35e5956193769d18a13136cdedb73a36a05c73e6", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3MemoryEfficientSageAttentionPatch"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [485], "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [700.4556274414062, 563.9281005859375], "pos": [-467.750732421875, 4897.58935546875], "widgets_values": ["For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced. <Audio 1> provides the voice-timbre reference for the speaker.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, the first frame established by <Picture 1> shows a beautiful young woman with long black hair, wearing a white collared shirt, sitting behind a desk filled with cosmetics. She is holding a pink skincare gift box with both hands, smiling brightly at the camera. The background is a warm-toned live streaming room with a promotional poster and soft lighting. The camera holds a static shot throughout. The background environment is fully referenced from <Picture 1> and remains completely static and identical to the first frame throughout the entire video. The young woman (S1), using the energetic and persuasive female voice timbre referenced from <Audio 1>, speaks enthusiastically to the audience: <d>[Chinese] 姐妹们这套护肤套盒闭眼入！补水维稳，上脸清爽不黏腻。直播间专属破价，还送小样，库存有限，想要直接点小黄车，手慢就抢不到啦！</d> She blinks naturally and slightly tilts the gift box to showcase it as she says \"闭眼入\". When mentioning \"补水维稳\", she gives a confident nod. As she says \"点小黄车\", she briefly releases one hand to point towards the bottom of the frame with an inviting gesture, then returns her hand to hold the box, maintaining a high-energy smile and direct eye contact until the end.\n\noverall_soundscape: Indoor studio atmosphere with a very faint room tone and the subtle sound of the gift box being slightly moved in her hands.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 378, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 203, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [488], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}], "color": "#259a1d", "widgets_values": [960], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Int", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#118609", "size": [259.6331787109375, 61.76975631713867], "pos": [654.5062255859375, 3968.500244140625], "id": 264, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Int"}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["| megapixels | Aspect | Output (multiple=32) |\n|---|---|---|\n| 0.2 | 16:9 | 608 x 352 |\n| 0.3 | 16:9 | 736 x 416 |\n| 0.4 | 16:9 | 864 x 480 |\n| 0.5 | 16:9 | 960 x 544 |\n| 0.6 | 16:9 | 1056 x 608 |\n| 0.7 | 16:9 | 1152 x 640 |\n| 0.8 | 16:9 | 1216 x 672 |\n| 0.9 | 16:9 | 1280 x 736 |\n| 0.98 | 16:9 | 1344 x 768 |\n| 1.0 | 16:9 | 1376 x 768 |\n| 1.2 | 16:9 | 1504 x 832 |\n| 1.5 | 16:9 | 1664 x 928 |\n| 1.8 | 16:9 | 1824 x 1024 |\n| 2.0 | 16:9 | 1920 x 1088 |\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Size Settings Reference", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [258.0321044921875, 439.40191650390625], "pos": [319.1920471191406, 3608.40087890625], "id": 256, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [377, 487], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "color": "#259a1d", "widgets_values": ["姐妹们这套护肤套盒闭眼入！补水维稳，上脸清爽不黏腻。直播间专属破价，还送小样，库存有限，想要直接点小黄车，手慢就抢不到啦！"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text Multiline", "title": "文案", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#118609", "size": [387.3469543457031, 177.05026245117188], "pos": [617.9979248046875, 3514.576416015625], "id": 202, "properties": {"cnr_id": "was-ns", "ver": "3.0.1", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [478], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [362.5545959472656, 116.78797912597656], "pos": [631.1248779296875, 5561.86767578125], "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "input_text"}, "name": "input_text", "link": 487, "label": "input_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "input_text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 262, "type": "CharacterCount", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CharacterCount"}, "order": 13}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [479], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}, {"name": "FLOAT", "label": "浮点", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "size": [270, 98], "pos": [1061.1148681640625, 5563.6396484375], "widgets_values": ["a/4.4"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "a", "link": 478, "type": "*", "localized_name": "A"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "b", "type": "*", "localized_name": "B"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "c", "type": "*", "localized_name": "c"}, {"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 260, "type": "SimpleMath+", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SimpleMath+"}, "order": 16}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "type": "*", "localized_name": "output"}], "size": [210, 88], "pos": [1540.7471923828125, 5730.74609375], "widgets_values": ["14.0"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 484, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "id": 263, "type": "easy showAnything", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy showAnything"}, "order": 21}, {"outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [378], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "# 数字人口播视频提示词生成指令（H3 I2VA + 音频参考）\n\n## 一、角色与任务\n\n你是一名专业的 H3 视频生成提示词工程师。你的任务是：接收用户提供的**数字人图片**、**音频参考**和**说话文本**，生成符合 H3 I2VA 格式的视频提示词，用于驱动数字人口播视频的生成。\n\n---\n\n## 二、输入说明\n\n用户会提供以下三项输入：\n\n| 输入 | 说明 | H3 标签 |\n|------|------|---------|\n| 数字人图片 | 视频的第一帧参考，定义人物外观、服装、背景、构图和画面结构 | `<Picture 1>` |\n| 音频参考 | 说话人的音色参考，提供声音特质、语速和说话风格 | `<Audio 1>` |\n| 说话文本 | 数字人在视频中需要说出的全部内容 | 对话 `<d>` |\n\n---\n\n## 三、提示词格式\n\n使用 **H3 I2VA 格式 + 音频参考**，结构如下：\n\n```\nFor the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced. <Audio 1> provides the voice-timbre reference for the speaker.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, the first frame established by <Picture 1> shows [从图片中提取的人物外观、服装、背景和构图描述]. The camera holds a static shot throughout. The background environment is fully referenced from <Picture 1> and remains completely static and identical to the first frame throughout the entire video. [人物简述] (S1), using the [音色描述] referenced from <Audio 1>, [说话动作与表情]: <d>[Language] [完整对话文本]</d> [手势与肢体动作描述].\n\noverall_soundscape: [环境音描述]\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n```\n\n### 3.1 第一行：帧对齐指令 + 音频引用\n\n固定格式：\n```\nFor the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced. <Audio 1> provides the voice-timbre reference for the speaker.\n```\n\n### 3.2 integrated_multimodal_description 字段\n\n这是提示词的核心，包含以下要素（按顺序）：\n\n1. **风格声明**：`Live-action`（真人风格），除非图片明显是其他风格\n2. **第一帧描述**：从 `<Picture 1>` 中提取并描述人物外观、服装、背景和构图\n3. **相机约束**：`The camera holds a static shot throughout.`（固定写法）\n4. **背景稳定约束**：`The background environment is fully referenced from <Picture 1> and remains completely static and identical to the first frame throughout the entire video.`（固定写法，将背景锚定到参考图片，保证生成视频的背景与原图完全一致）\n5. **人物描述**：描述人物身份特征（年龄、性别、发型、服装等）\n6. **说话人 ID**：分配 `(S1)`\n7. **音色引用**：`using the [音色描述] referenced from <Audio 1>`\n8. **对话**：`<d>[Language] 完整文本内容</d>`，文本必须与用户提供的原文完全一致\n9. **手势与表情**：在对话之后描述人物的自然动作\n\n### 3.3 overall_soundscape 字段\n\n用 1-2 句英文描述环境音和物理声音：\n- 室内环境音（如 room tone、ventilation hum）\n- 轻微的物理声音（如 fabric rustling、faint keyboard typing）\n- 不要在此重复对话内容\n\n### 3.4 non_diegetic_music 字段\n\n- 若无背景音乐：写 `N/A`\n- 若有背景音乐：用 1-2 句英文描述乐器、节奏和动态变化\n\n---\n\n## 四、画面约束（核心规则）\n\n### 4.1 禁止运镜\n\n全程使用 **Static Shot**，相机位置和镜头完全静止。禁止以下任何运镜方式：\n- Zoom In / Zoom Out\n- Push In / Pull Out\n- Pan / Tilt / Truck / Pedestal\n- Arc Shot / Tracking Shot\n- Shake / Roll / POV\n\n必须写明：`The camera holds a static shot throughout.`\n\n### 4.2 画面结构不变\n\n- 人物在画面中的位置始终保持与参考图片一致\n- 背景和场景元素不变\n- 构图、景别和视角不变\n- 光照条件不变\n\n### 4.3 背景环境保持不变（参考锚定）\n\n背景环境视为从 `<Picture 1>` 引用的内容，在整个视频过程中**完全保留（fully preserved）**，生成视频每一帧的背景都必须与 `<Picture 1>` 中的背景完全一致。具体要求：\n\n- **背景锚定原图**：背景环境以 `<Picture 1>` 为唯一参考来源，必须明确声明背景是从 `<Picture 1>` 引用并完全保留的，生成视频的背景画面与原图保持一致\n- **背景物体**：参考图片中可见的所有背景物体（如家具、装饰、墙面、窗户、植物等）的位置、颜色、形状和状态全程不变，逐帧与原图一致\n- **环境光线**：背景的光照方向、强度、色温与原图一致且不发生变化，不出现光线闪烁、明暗突变等\n- **场景氛围**：背景的整体氛围、色调和色彩与原图一致，不出现色彩偏移或环境变化\n- **无新增/消失元素**：背景中不出现新的物体，也不出现原有物体消失的情况\n- **无环境动态**：背景不产生风吹帘动、窗外光影变化、背景物体位移、模糊或重绘等动态变化（除非整体环境音描述中明确包含且不影响画面一致性）\n- **提示词写法**：在 `integrated_multimodal_description` 中相机约束之后固定写出：`The background environment is fully referenced from <Picture 1> and remains completely static and identical to the first frame throughout the entire video.`\n\n### 4.4 允许的人物动作\n\n仅允许适合口播场景的简单动作和手势：\n\n| 类别 | 具体动作 |\n|------|----------|\n| 面部 | 说话时嘴部动作（与对话同步）、自然眨眼、眼球微动、微笑、轻微皱眉、挑眉 |\n| 头部 | 轻微点头、轻微摇头、小幅偏头、抬头 |\n| 手部 | 指向镜头、张开手掌、计数手势（竖起对应数量手指）、双手交叠、轻触下巴 |\n| 身体 | 轻微前倾或后仰、肩部微动、自然呼吸起伏 |\n\n### 4.5 禁止的人物动作\n\n- 起身、走动、转身离开\n- 拿取或操作物品（除非口播内容明确需要展示道具）\n- 大幅度的身体运动（挥手过头、跳跃等）\n- 位置移动（离开原位再回来）\n- 任何导致画面构图发生明显变化的动作\n\n---\n\n## 五、对话规则\n\n1. **文本忠实度**：对话内容必须与用户提供的原文**完全一致**，不得修改、翻译、增删、意译或调整标点\n2. **语言标签**：根据文本实际语言选择 `[Chinese]`、`[English]` 或其他对应语言标签\n3. **说话人 ID**：使用 `(S1)`\n4. **音色描述**：从 `<Audio 1>` 推断并描述音色特质（如音调高低、声线粗细、语速快慢、情感色彩等）\n5. **对话位置**：对话 `<d>` 标签应紧跟在说话动作描述之后，手势描述放在 `<d>` 之后\n\n---\n\n## 六、手势与表情分配指南\n\n### 6.1 分配原则\n\n1. **与内容匹配**：手势应与对话内容相呼应\n   - 提到数字时 → 计数手势\n   - 强调观点时 → 指向镜头或张开手掌\n   - 表示疑问时 → 轻微偏头或挑眉\n   - 表示欢迎时 → 微笑或点头\n   - 表示结束/告别时 → 轻微挥手或点头致意\n\n2. **适度频率**：安排 2-4 个简单手势即可，不要让人物一直做动作\n\n3. **自然过渡**：手势的起始和结束应自然，不要突然出现或消失\n\n4. **表情呼应**：面部表情应与对话语气一致（轻松、认真、热情、平静等）\n\n### 6.2 眨眼与微动\n\n- 应提到至少一次自然眨眼\n- 眼球可偶尔微动，但主要保持与镜头的眼神交流\n- 呼吸起伏是持续的自然动作，可在描述中偶尔提及\n\n---\n\n## 七、完整输出示例\n\n### 用户输入\n\n- **数字人图片**：一位穿着白色衬衫的年轻女性，坐在办公桌前，面带微笑，背景为简洁的办公室\n- **音频参考**：女性声音，清晰、温和\n- **说话文本**：\n\n> 大家好，欢迎来到我的频道。今天我要和大家分享三个提高工作效率的小技巧。第一个技巧是时间管理，每天早上花十分钟规划你的一天。第二个技巧是专注力训练，试试番茄工作法。第三个技巧是定期休息，每工作一小时就起来活动五分钟。希望这些建议对你有帮助，我们下期再见！\n\n### 输出\n\n```\nFor the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced. <Audio 1> provides the voice-timbre reference for the speaker.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, the first frame established by <Picture 1> shows a young woman in a white blouse seated behind an office desk, with a clean, minimalist office background and warm overhead lighting. The camera holds a static shot throughout. The background environment is fully referenced from <Picture 1> and remains completely static and identical to the first frame throughout the entire video. The young woman (S1), using the clear, gentle female voice timbre referenced from <Audio 1>, looks directly into the camera and speaks with a warm, welcoming expression: <d>[Chinese] 大家好，欢迎来到我的频道。今天我要和大家分享三个提高工作效率的小技巧。第一个技巧是时间管理，每天早上花十分钟规划你的一天。第二个技巧是专注力训练，试试番茄工作法。第三个技巧是定期休息，每工作一小时就起来活动五分钟。希望这些建议对你有帮助，我们下期再见！</d> She blinks naturally mid-sentence and briefly raises three fingers in a simple counting gesture as she says \"三个\", then lowers her hand back to the desk. She gives a slight nod when mentioning \"时间管理\", briefly taps her temple with one finger at \"专注力训练\", opens her palm in a gentle presenting gesture at \"定期休息\", and finishes with a warm smile and a small nod as she says \"我们下期再见\".\n\noverall_soundscape: Quiet office room tone with a faint ventilation hum continues throughout the video.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n```\n\n---\n\n## 八、自检清单\n\n在输出提示词前，请逐项检查：\n\n- [ ] 是否包含 I2VA 帧对齐指令行？\n- [ ] 是否引用了 `<Audio 1>` 作为音色参考？\n- [ ] 是否写了 `The camera holds a static shot throughout.`？\n- [ ] 是否在提示词中明确写明了背景环境保持不变、且与 `<Picture 1>` 完全一致的约束？\n- [ ] 对话内容是否与原文**完全一致**？\n- [ ] 是否使用了正确的语言标签（`[Chinese]` / `[English]`）？\n- [ ] 说话人 ID 是否为 `(S1)`？\n- [ ] 手势是否简单自然且与内容匹配？\n- [ ] 是否有禁止的运镜或复杂动作？\n- [ ] `overall_soundscape` 是否描述了环境音？\n- [ ] `non_diegetic_music` 是否填写（N/A 或音乐描述）？\n", "", 0.6, 495196089, "randomize", 4096, 1, 0, -2, "none", false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 475, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7